    "description": "Make two tables. The first: caption, thead with three th scope=\"col\", tbody with at least three rows, the first cell of each row is th scope=\"row\". The second: \"Long class\" with one cell rowspan=\"2\".",
    "starter_code": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <title>Club schedule</title>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <main>\n        <h1>Club schedule</h1>\n        <!-- Table 1: caption, thead (3 th scope=\"col\"), tbody (3 rows, first cell th scope=\"row\") -->\n\n        <!-- Table 2: \"Long class\", one cell with rowspan=\"2\" -->\n    </main>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
